te for C# users:** If your issue is *not* C#-specific, please upload a minimal reproduction project written in GDScript. This will make it easier for contributors to reproduce the issue locally as not everyone has a .NET setup available. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3018413356/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3018505638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108110#issuecomment-3018505638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108110","id":3018505638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6z6r2m","user":{"login":"gitMatCap","id":218477362,"node_id":"U_kgDODQWzMg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218477362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitMatCap","html_url":"https://github.com/gitMatCap","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitMatCap/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitMatCap/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitMatCap/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitMatCap/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitMatCap/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitMatCap/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitMatCap/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitMatCap/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gitMatCap/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-30T09:48:33Z","updated_at":"2025-06-30T09:48:33Z","body":"Is this better?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3018505638/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3019181827","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108110#issuecomment-3019181827","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108110","id":3019181827,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6z9Q8D","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-30T13:32:51Z","updated_at":"2025-06-30T13:32:51Z","body":"Thanks for the report! Just copying over what I wrote on https://github.com/GodotVR/godot_openxr_vendors/issues/319\n\nThe error comes from this line:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/de9665efa50696dcf21beef2eb30d9ecdafab410/core/input/input.cpp#L1226\n\nInput from XR controllers shouldn't even be going through here - this is code for handling normal gamepads. Perhaps Pico is presenting these particular buttons as coming from a virtual non-XR gamepad? I don't know if there's a good way to detect and ignore that?","author_asso