":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3166267073","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108110#issuecomment-3166267073","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108110","id":3166267073,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68uWbB","user":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T01:06:09Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T01:06:09Z","body":"Bit more feedback on this. I have witnessed this happening as well.\n\nIt seems something in the Android joystick system is picking up garbage input from the XR controllers. So far I've been told that this should not be the case, however it does seem like an OS issue on the PICO headsets that we can't do much about.\n\nIf we learn more and do find out there it's cause on our end we'll chase it up further, but at the moment we're not aware of a cause.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.